text = "This is serious matter MARKOV. You have been assigned  to perform a task without questioning the methods. Everything that is preformed in the lab, stays in the lab. Breaking the rule, will result in consequenses.

We need you to find a solution that kills the unknown virus. You will receive samples, which can be tested on.

You are not entitled to gain more information then provided. Furfill this task, and you will be compensated 4.600.000 Kc. 

