text = "The three of them died today. All because of that damned thing. You are the only person we know who is probably not infected. Find something to fight this disease, please. Whatever. You are the only left.
These two flasks are what the farmacist marked as the only hope of the colony. We know that each chemical has a specific use. The problem is identifying what is for what and how to combine both."

